---
<lem-type Note extends Page>
  at: url = urlOf()
  layout: (Note, html): html
</lem-type>

<lem-fn urlOf(): url = page.url />

`urlOf` reads `page`, which is fine where it stands — a layout may call it — but a
default reads only the record it builds, and the link step names the call that
reaches out of it.
